---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const SITE_NAME = import.meta.env.SITE_NAME || "Site Name";

---

<Layout
  title={`${SITE_NAME} - DMCA Policy | Soccer100 & Soccer Streams`}
  description={`${SITE_NAME} - DMCA Policy for Soccer100 and Soccer Streams. We respect intellectual property rights and follow DMCA guidelines.`}
  keywords={`${SITE_NAME}, Soccer100, Soccer Streams, DMCA Policy, Copyright`}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-left">
    <div class="mx-3 prose max-w-none theme-text-primary p-8">
      <div>
        <h1>DMCA Policy</h1>
        <p>
          This page outlines our approach to copyright concerns in accordance with the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA).
        </p>

        <h2>Copyright Notice</h2>
        <p>
          We respect the intellectual property rights of others and expect our users to do the same. Our site provides scheduling information and links to third-party streaming platforms. We do not host, upload, or control any video content available on external websites.
        </p>

        <h2>No Content Hosting</h2>
        <p>
          This platform acts as a directory and aggregator of publicly available links. All streaming content is hosted and managed by independent third-party service providers. We do not store, transmit, or manage any copyrighted media on our servers.
        </p>

        <h2>Content Removal Requests (DMCA)</h2>
        <p>
          If you believe that content linked on our site infringes your copyright, we recommend contacting the hosting provider directly, as they control the actual content. However, if you believe there is a valid concern related to our site, please include the following details in your request:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your full name, address, phone number, and email address</li>
          <li>A clear description of the copyrighted work in question</li>
          <li>
            The specific URL or location on our site where the material appears
          </li>
          <li>
            A statement confirming your good faith belief that the use is unauthorized
          </li>
          <li>
            An acknowledgement that the information provided is accurate, under penalty of perjury
          </li>
          <li>
            Your physical or electronic signature (as the copyright owner or an authorized agent)
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Counter-Notice</h2>
        <p>
          If you believe content was removed or disabled by mistake, you can submit a counter-notice. This must include your contact details, identification of the affected content, a statement of good faith belief that the removal was by mistake, consent to jurisdiction, and your signature.
        </p>

        <h2>Repeat Infringers</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to restrict or terminate access for users who repeatedly violate copyright policies. Additionally, links to external sources reported and verified as infringing may be removed from our directory.
        </p>

        <h2>DMCA Contact</h2>
        <p>
          To submit a DMCA notice or inquiry, please use our contact page and include "DMCA Notice" in the subject line to ensure proper handling.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
